
# Start the Roadmap backend before sending requests.
# Floci must be running with the Roadmap DynamoDB tables.

@api = http://localhost:3001

### Health check - Expect HTTP 200
GET {{api}}/health

### Read categories from DynamoDB - Expect HTTP 200 and seven items
GET {{api}}/api/categories

### Unknown endpoint - Expect HTTP 404
GET {{api}}/api/unknown
